    "title": {
      "zh": "逻辑门",
      "en": "Logic Gates"
    }
  },
  "stage": "explain",
  "title": {
    "zh": "同样的开关，不同的规则",
    "en": "Same Switches, Different Rules"
  },
  "concept": {
    "zh": "AND、OR、NOT 与 XOR",
    "en": "AND, OR, NOT, and XOR"
  },
  "brief": {
    "zh": "把同一组输入接到不同的逻辑门，看看输出为什么会变。",
    "en": "Connect the same inputs to different logic gates and see why the output changes."
  },
  "hints": [],
  "sections": [
    {
      "title": {
        "zh": "AND 看两边，OR 看有没有",
        "en": "AND needs both, OR needs at least one"
      },
      "body": {
        "zh": "AND 只有两个输入都是 1 时才输出 1。OR 在至少一个输入是 1 时输出 1。只有一盏输入灯亮时，两个门的结果就不同。",
        "en": "AND outputs 1 when both inputs are 1. OR outputs 1 when at least one input is 1. With one input on, the two gates give different answers."
      }
    },
    {
      "title": {
        "zh": "NOT 只处理左输入",
        "en": "NOT uses the left input"
      },
      "body": {
        "zh": "NOT 把 1 翻成 0，也把 0 翻成 1。这块控制板上，NOT 读左边的 A。拨右边的 B 时，NOT 的输出保持原样。",
        "en": "NOT turns 1 into 0 and 0 into 1. On this panel, it reads the left input A. Flipping the right input B leaves the NOT output as it was."
      }
    },
    {
      "title": {
        "zh": "XOR 检查两边是否不同",
        "en": "XOR checks whether the inputs differ"
      },
      "body": {
        "zh": "XOR 只有一边是 1 时才亮。两个输入都是 1 时，OR 的灯亮着，XOR 的灯熄灭。",
        "en": "XOR lights up when exactly one input is 1. With both inputs set to 1, OR lights up and XOR stays off."
      }
    }
  ],
  "question": {
    "prompt": {
      "zh": "A 和 B 都是 1 时，哪一个说法正确？",
      "en": "When A and B are both 1, which statement is correct?"
    },
    "options": [
      {
        "zh": "OR 和 XOR 都输出 0",
        "en": "OR and XOR both output 0"
      },
      {
        "zh": "OR 输出 1，XOR 输出 0",
        "en": "OR outputs 1 and XOR outputs 0"
      },
      {
        "zh": "OR 输出 0，XOR 输出 1",
        "en": "OR outputs 0 and XOR outputs 1"
      }
    ],
    "correct": 1,
    "feedback": {
      "zh": "OR 只需要至少一边亮。XOR 需要刚好一边亮，所以两边都亮时它输出 0。",
      "en": "OR needs at least one input on. XOR needs exactly one. Both inputs are on here, so XOR outputs 0."
    }
  },
